<section class="sl pg" data-p="home"><div class="slw"><h2>Farming made easy</h2><p class="intro">Order in four simple steps.</p>
<ol class="steps">
<li><b>Browse products</b>Search or filter by category, crop or price.</li>
<li><b>Choose a pack size</b>Pick size and quantity, then add to cart.</li>
<li><b>Place your order</b>Pay by cash on delivery, UPI or card.</li>
<li><b>Get delivery</b>Track your order to your doorstep.</li>
</ol></div></section>

<section class="sl alt pg" data-p="home"><div class="slw"><h2>Season-wise crops</h2><p class="intro">Find out which crop suits the season and choose the right protection.</p>
<div class="seasons">
<div><h3>Kharif crops</h3><span class="when">June to October</span><p>Monsoon crops such as rice, maize, cotton and soybean. They need warm weather and plenty of water.</p></div>
<div><h3>Rabi crops</h3><span class="when">October to March</span><p>Winter crops such as wheat, barley, mustard and gram. Sown in winter and harvested in spring.</p></div>
<div><h3>Zaid crops</h3><span class="when">March to June</span><p>Summer crops such as watermelon, cucumber and bitter gourd, grown between Rabi and Kharif.</p></div>
</div></div></section>

<section class="sl pg" data-p="home"><div class="slw"><p class="eyebrow">Our range</p><h2>Complete crop care in one place</h2><p class="intro">Our product range, as listed in the Praveka brochure.</p>
